  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Entry points & governance",
      "items": [
        "omni-gateway serves HTTP :8080 or runs behind --stdio; unified 2026-07-28 capability negotiation and server/discover parity across /omni/mcp, /groups/<slug>/mcp and /<service>/mcp",
        "Studio UI v4: Skills Studio, Tasks Monitor and a unified Approval & Elicitation Inbox",
        "ABAC charter policies plus ElicitationPolicyRule, 16-shard rate limiting, DFA PII redaction, Merkle-chained audit on accept/decline"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Control plane & HA state",
      "items": [
        "CoW Arc routing table with canary routing, fallback and circuit breakers; bounded PgWirePool (OMNI_PG_POOL_SIZE=8) ends single-connection starvation",
        "Channel-dispatched LISTEN/NOTIFY (omni_registry_changed vs omni_task_changed) prevents task updates from triggering server catalog reload storms",
        "Fleet-aware SkillEngine merges curated persisted skills with auto-synthesized Tool Group / Virtual Service Code Mode playbooks, digested to manifest_sha256",
        "Multi-replica HA OAuth flows and tokens (ChaCha20-Poly1305 AEAD) across Postgres / SQLite / WAL; migrate state with omni migrate --to-v6.8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Code Mode, tasks & files",
      "items": [
        "In-process AST VM (~100 µs) with optional wasmi sandbox; Wasm Guest ABI v2 adds omni::file_stat and omni::file_read_chunk (max 256 KiB/call, fuel-metered, no ambient FS access)",
        "GA MCP Tasks: durable Postgres HA persistence, atomic CAS transitions, 60-second TTL reaper, 64-task concurrency cap, cooperative cancellation with LIFO Saga unwind",
        "Elicitation form/url modes: resultType input_required, strict secret-safety and primitive-schema validation, decline triggers Saga rollback",
        "Opt-in file uploads (SEP-2356): 64 MiB chunked streaming bypass with FileBlobBackend for local, postgres, s3, gcs, azure and http/WebDAV"
      ]
    }
  ]
